# Internal planning and audit reports: kept locally for the work, never published.
# They were removed from the branch's history in a filter-branch rewrite; the ignore
# rules stop a later `git add -A` from putting them back.
*-REPORT.md
IMPLEMENTATION-PLAN.md
NEXT-SESSION-PROMPT.md
